cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use fumadocs-fortran in published work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "fumadocs-fortran: Fortran API reference for Fumadocs"
abstract: >-
  Fortran API reference for Fumadocs documentation sites, generated as MDX by its own parser. It reads FORD, Doxygen
  and LAPACK doc comments and understands HPC code: OpenMP and OpenACC directives, MPI, coarrays, and calls into BLAS,
  LAPACK and ScaLAPACK.
authors:
  - family-names: Golenić
    given-names: Neven
    website: https://github.com/Nevensky
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Nevensky/fumadocs-fortran
url: https://nevensky.github.io/fumadocs-fortran/
keywords:
  - Fortran
  - API documentation
  - high-performance computing
  - Fumadocs
  - MDX
